%% Token lifecycle. See 02-iam/token-and-session-design.md and ADR-0003.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor u as User
    participant shell as apps/shell
    participant iam as fusion-iam
    participant plat as fusion-platform
    participant legacy as legacy monolith
    participant redis as Redis

    u->>shell: username + password
    shell->>iam: POST /auth/login  (throttled 5/min per IP, 10/h per username)
    Note over iam: Argon2id verify · progressive lockout<br/>generic error on failure (no user enumeration)
    iam->>iam: create identity_session + identity_refresh_token
    iam-->>shell: Set-Cookie fusion_at  (JWT RS256, 10 min, HttpOnly, Path=/)<br/>Set-Cookie fusion_rt  (opaque, Path=/app/api/iam/v1/auth, Strict)<br/>Set-Cookie fusion_csrf (readable, for double-submit)

    shell->>iam: GET /me   (cookie)
    iam-->>shell: user · roles · active_role · permissions · pv<br/>modules · navigation (render shape) · idle_timeout

    par local validation, no IAM round trip
        shell->>plat: GET /placement/postings
        plat->>iam: GET /.well-known/jwks.json (cached 10 min, nginx + Redis)
        plat->>redis: is sid denylisted?
        plat-->>shell: 200
    and legacy keeps working unchanged
        shell->>legacy: GET /api/auth/me
        Note over legacy: IamJWTAuthentication first,<br/>TokenAuthentication second — old tokens still valid
        legacy-->>shell: byte-identical legacy response shape
    end

    Note over shell: 10 minutes pass
    shell->>plat: GET /placement/postings
    plat-->>shell: 401
    Note over shell: single-flight: N concurrent 401s queue<br/>behind ONE refresh, then replay
    shell->>iam: POST /auth/refresh  (fusion_rt only)
    alt token unused
        iam->>iam: rotate — mark old used, issue child
        iam-->>shell: new fusion_at + fusion_rt
    else token already used → replay detected
        iam->>iam: revoke the ENTIRE token family
        iam-->>shell: 401
        shell->>shell: clear hint, hard redirect to /login
    end

    u->>shell: Logout
    shell->>iam: POST /auth/logout
    iam->>iam: identity_session.revoked_at = now()
    iam->>redis: denylist sid for 10 min (one access-token lifetime)
    iam-->>shell: clear all three cookies
